<code style='font-size: 11px;'>attention/lightning_indexer_grad/op_kernel/lightning_indexer_grad_kernel.h</code></div><div style='margin: 1px 0;'><strong>行号</strong>: 450</div><div style='margin: 3px 0 1px 0; font-size: 11px;'><strong>问题代码</strong>:</div><pre style='margin: 1px 0; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10px; background: #f5f5f5; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 2px; overflow-x: auto;'>vectorService.DeterministicMerge(dkCoreWorkspaceGM,dkWorkSpaceGm, constInfo, runInfoStore[taskId]);</pre><div style='margin: 3px 0 1px 0; font-size: 11px;'><strong>修改建议</strong>:</div><pre style='margin: 1px 0; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10px; background: #f0f8ff; border: 1px solid #cce0ff; border-radius: 2px;'>建议在逗号后添加空格，以提高代码可读性。修改为：vectorService.DeterministicMerge(dkCoreWorkspaceGM, dkWorkSpaceGm, constInfo, runInfoStore[taskId]);</pre><div style='margin-top: 4px; font-size: 9px; color: #999;'>---<br>此评论由代码审查工具自动生成</div></div>","created_at":"2026-03-09T15:22:38+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-09T15:24:47+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"68844ee22fa6cc24b2556707","login":"cc-z","object_id":"68844ee22fa6cc24b2556707","name":"赵臣臣","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cc-z"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":450,"end_new_line":450,"start_old_line":450,"end_old_line":450,"position_type":"text"}},{"id":164669091,"discussion_id":"1d7c09e7a4be0f6fba952f00c56142f170deceb2","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR主要修复了LightningIndexerGrad算子在确定性计算模式下的核心逻辑错误和代码冗余问题。核心修复包括：1）修正了tiling计算中`dkCoreSize`参数未考虑批次维度（`batch`）的错误，该错误可能导致工作空间分配不足和计算错误；2）移除了内核代码中已不再使用的冗余`dkCoreSize`参数及相关数据结构，统一了梯度归并与初始化的计算逻辑；3）优化了确定性合并（DeterministicMerge）函数的内存使用和循环逻辑，提升了处理效率。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改方案涉及算子内核、tiling数据结构及工具函数。首先，将tiling计算中`dkCoreSize`的计算公式从`seqlenK * headDim`修正为`batch * seqlenK * headDim`，确保与工作空间偏移计算一致。其次，在`lightning_indexer_grad_kernel.h`及`_pre.h`文件中，移除所有冗余的`dkCoreSize`参数，并将梯度初始化与归并的逻辑统一基于`dkSize`和`batch`进行计算。同时，从`LIGTilingData`类中彻底删除`dkCoreSize`成员及其接口。最后，重构`DeterministicMerge`函数，动态计算UB大小并简化循环，提升了代码效率和清晰度。","created_at":"2026-03-09T15:23:39+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-09T15:23:39+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":164676987,"discussion_id":"c95ea9674f0a1964395d5060875965a4d4239357","body":"/lgtm\n/approve","created_at":"2026-03-09T16:01:36+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-09T16:01:36+08:00","user":{"id":"68844ee22fa6cc24b2556707","login":"cc-z","object_id":"68844ee22fa6cc24b2556707","name":"赵臣臣","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cc-z"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":164678362,"discussion_id":"58f5d9cd2fb1b213394c70e07f97b97561db9fb5","body":"/lgtm","created_at":"2026-03-09T16:07:58+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-09T16:07:58+08:00","user":{"id":"6822c65e59bdd61f837dbc5a","login":"yu-xinjie62","object_id":"6822c65e59bdd61f837dbc5a","name":"於欣洁","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/yu-xinjie62"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":164678394,"discussion_id":"da2753adba054020e8ae01d63167855ffdd2d7e4","body":"### Review Guide\n\n This pull-request **passes review**.\n Committers who wrote a comment of `/approve` are: [*cc-z*](https://gitcode.com/cc-z).\nReviewers who wrote a comment of `/lgtm` are: [*yu-xinjie62*](https://gitcode.com/yu-xinjie62), [*cc-z*](https://gitcode.com/cc-z).\n","created_at":"2026-03-09T16:08:10+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-09T16:08:10+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295c